The released artifact (runtime-python-<version>-r<N>.aar) redistributes the
third-party components listed below. Each component remains under its own
license. The full license texts are in the licenses/ directory of this
repository and are attached to every release (licenses.tar.gz). Where a
component's license file is also shipped inside the runtime zip
(usr/lib/python3.14/site-packages/*.dist-info/), that copy applies as well.

Versions marked (R0) are the ones R0 changes; everything else is copied byte
for byte from the upstream AAR io.github.deniscerri:ytdlnis_packages.python:3.14.6
(SHA-256 ce6d36f9eff8d4c0ee1440f613285e5112ff1d8713a3a4d8d6f996d44200b115),
which was built with the Termux build system (termux-packages; the upstream
build did not record its commit; versions match commit
2935d0eeff6eb9270227a72dc3d87bbce9c938de, the last commit before the upstream
build time 2026-07-12 07:06 UTC; inferred).

